## 🎯 Day 38 Objective

Days 34–37 built the four artifacts of a working AI governance program: the **Risk Register**, the **Intake/Impact Assessment**, the **Model Card + RAI Review**, and the **Incident Response Playbook**. But templates don't govern anything on their own — someone has to *run* them, on a cadence, with clear authority to say yes and no.

Today I built the **operating model** that turns those four templates into a living management system: the **governance board charter**, the **decision rights (who can approve what)**, the **operating cadence (what happens weekly/monthly/quarterly)**, and the **KPI dashboard** a VP takes to the executive committee to prove the program works.

